      "content": "i dont know how to explain it. everything looks fine on the outside. i have a good house, a job that pays well, people who care about me... but it just feels like i'm watching my life through a thick pane of glass. everything is just gray. i feel absolutely nothing. it’s like i’m already dead but i’m still walking around.",
