    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but i feel like a fraud. like, what would i even say? \"hey im miserable but i have a perfect life and a nice car so i dont actually have a reason to be sad.\" it just feels so pointless. therapy won't change the fact that everything is just... empty. the emptiness is the only thing that feels real anymore.",
